Recovery of missing strain data under multiple time-varying effects using IMM Kalman filtering
Ke Gao a , Shun Weng a,b,*, Hong-Ping Zhu a,b,c, Chao-Jun Chen a,d
a School of Civil and Hydraulic Engineering, Huazhong University of Science and Technology, Wuhan, China
